                <pb facs="0892" n="796" xml:id="pg796"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Russell to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September 15,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Revolutionists took Valencia yesterday. President returning to Caracas. Where is
                    war vessel? Permission granted to make survey mentioned yesterday’s cable.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
